            "title": "TRADING CARDS",
            "text": "Everything you need to know about exploring our trading card collection."
          }
        },
        "c1q1": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "WHAT TYPES OF TRADING CARDS CAN I FIND AT TCG HITZ?",
            "answer": "<p>Explore the available trading cards in our store, including products listed across our different collections. Product availability and details are displayed on each product page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c1q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "HOW CAN I FIND A SPECIFIC TRADING CARD?",
            "answer": "<p>Use the search bar at the top of the page, or browse the Trading Cards collections and filter by set, rarity or price.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c1q3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "HOW DO I CHECK A CARD'S CONDITION?",
            "answer": "<p>Each product page lists the card's condition and shows real photos of the exact card. Our condition guide explains what each grade means.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c1q4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "ARE ALL LISTED CARDS AVAILABLE FOR PURCHASE?",
            "answer": "<p>Cards shown as in stock are available to order. If a card sells out, the product page will show it as sold out.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c1q5": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "WILL I RECEIVE THE EXACT CARD SHOWN IN THE PRODUCT PHOTOS?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Single cards are photographed individually, so the card you see is the card you receive.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c2": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "MYSTERY PACKS",
            "text": "Get answers about how our mystery packs work and what to expect."
          }
        },
        "c2q1": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "WHAT ARE TCG HITZ MYSTERY PACKS?",
            "answer": "<p>Mystery packs are products whose contents are determined by the specific offering. Product details are available on each mystery pack listing page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c2q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "DO ALL MYSTERY PACKS CONTAIN THE SAME ITEMS?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Contents vary by pack. Each listing describes what kind of items may be included.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c2q3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "CAN I SEE WHAT'S INSIDE A MYSTERY PACK BEFORE PURCHASING?",
            "answer": "<p>Mystery packs are sealed surprises, so the exact contents aren't revealed. The product description explains what the pack offers.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c2q4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "ARE RARE CARDS GUARANTEED IN MYSTERY PACKS?",
            "answer": "<p>Unless a listing says otherwise, specific cards or rarities are not guaranteed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c2q5": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "HOW DO I CHOOSE THE RIGHT MYSTERY PACK?",
            "answer": "<p>Browse the Mystery Packs collection, compare the product descriptions and pick the pack that matches your interests and budget.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c3": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "GRADED CARDS",
            "text": "Find more about our graded cards and how to read their details."
          }
        },
        "c3q1": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "WHAT IS A GRADED TRADING CARD?",
            "answer": "<p>A graded card has been professionally evaluated and assigned a grade by a grading service. The specific grading company, grade and other details are shown on the product page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c3q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "WHERE CAN I FIND THE CARD'S GRADE?",
            "answer": "<p>The grade and grading company are listed in the product title and description, and are visible on the label in the product photos.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c3q3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "WILL I RECEIVE THE EXACT GRADED CARD SHOWN IN THE LISTING?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Graded cards are photographed individually, so you receive the exact slab shown.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c3q4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "HOW CAN I CHECK THE GRADING DETAILS?",
            "answer": "<p>Use the certification number on the slab's label to look the card up on the grading company's website.</p>"
          }
        },
