            "question": "WHAT MERCHANDISE DOES TCG HITZ SELL?",
            "answer": "<p>Our Merchandise collection includes 3D-printed collectibles, figures and other items for fans. Each product page shows the details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c4q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "HOW DO I CHOOSE THE RIGHT SIZE?",
            "answer": "<p>If a product comes in different sizes, the options and measurements are listed on its product page.</p>"
