          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "HOW LONG DOES IT TAKE TO RECEIVE A VENDING MACHINE?",
            "answer": "<p>Each machine is built to order in about 2 weeks and tested for 2–4 days, then ships by ocean freight in about 3–4 weeks and arrives by LTL freight. The estimated total lead time is 5–6 weeks.</p>"
